OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning, wet in the    
OL,6,Fwest, dry initially along the coast. A 
OL,7,Fband of rain slowly progresses         
OL,8,Feastwards throughout the day, likely   
OL,9,Ffalling as snow or freezing rain over  
OL,10,Fthe Yorkshire Dales. Feeling cold.     
OL,12,CTonight:FWet in the west, dry          
OL,13,Finitially along the coast. A band of   
OL,14,Frain slowly progresses eastwards,      
OL,15,Flikely falling as snow or freezing     
OL,16,Frain over the Yorkshire Dales. Feeling 
OL,17,Fcold.                                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
